    "detailed_description": "Every morning he gets into his car and goes out to restore order on the streets of his hometown. He has several rules and one of them is that he will never leave leaving the territory dirty. Whether it\u2019s a bottle left behind after drinking or someone\u2019s forgotten refrigerator, the street cleaner will get rid of everything.<br />\r\nHave you ever dreamed of cleaning the streets? This game is for you<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Various locations for cleaning<br />\r\n-Atmospheric<br />\r\n-A puzzle game where at each level you will find 7 hidden objects that need to be removed (taken to the car). Items can be either just bottles or refrigerators.<br />\r\n-Achievements",
